$Descr User 33110 220000
Sheet 1 1
Title "DM-02 TX1 serial text candidate"
Date "2026-11-14"
Rev "CP1-TX1"
Comp "DM-02"
Comment1 "Independent DIP/THT candidate; local 4 MHz clock, nominal 9600 baud 8N1."
Comment2 "One persistent mailbox credit; separate transmit register; reset aborts frames."
Comment3 "J2 is 5 V TTL TX/GND, not RS-232. Receiver and cable require qualification."
Comment4 "Native simulation excludes metastability, analog edges and physical acceptance."
$EndDescr
